    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1782">

                <pb facs="1451" n="1335" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/168.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the President of
                    Salvador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Mrs. Knox and myself I thank you for your courteous telegram of
                    congratulation and assure you that I shall always remember kindness of yourself
                    and the people of Salvador during my visit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
